Root cause:
The bug was caused by the wake-up mechanism for waiters in the ring buffer only checking the `wakeup_full` variable and not considering the `full_waiters_pending` variable. This oversight meant that when a waiter was added to the wait queue, it could remain unawakened if the `wakeup_full` was not set, leading to potential deadlocks or missed wake-up signals when the ring buffer was closed.



